# IDs from a fresh seed: Morning Run in the Park = 6; Pastry Masterclass = 19.
@eventId = 6
@notGoingEventId = 19

### History (200; newest first)
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/{{eventId}}/messages
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

### Older messages (200; only messages sent before the given time)
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/{{eventId}}/messages?before=2026-11-06T14:00:00Z&size=30
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

### History of an event the user is not going to (403)
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/{{notGoingEventId}}/messages
X-User-Id: {{userId}}